  <h1>Micro Loans</h1>
  <section id="apply" class="container">
    <h2>Discover the Perfect Micro  Loans for Your Lifestyle</h2>
    <p>At RupeeXpert, we understand that sometimes you need a small amount of money quickly to cover unexpected expenses or immediate needs. Our micro loans are designed to provide you with fast and convenient access to funds, helping you manage your short-term financial needs effectively.</p>
</section>
  <section id="selection" class="container">
    <h2>Why Choose a Micro Loan through RupeeXpert?</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Quick Access to Funds:</strong>Our micro loans are ideal for those times when you need cash urgently. We offer fast processing and quick disbursement so you can get the funds you need without delay.</li>
        <li><strong>Simple Application Process:</strong> Applying for a micro loan is easy and hassle-free. Our online application process is designed to be straightforward, allowing you to complete it in just a few steps.</li>
        <li><strong>Flexible Amounts:</strong>Whether you need a small loan to cover an emergency expense or a minor financial gap, we offer flexible loan amounts to suit your needs.</li>
        <li><strong>Transparent Terms:</strong>We provide clear and transparent loan terms with no hidden fees, so you know exactly what to expect.</li>
        <li><strong>Fast Approval:</strong>We aim to provide quick approvals so you can get the cash you need as soon as possible. Our efficient process ensures minimal wait times.</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section id="benefits" class="container">
    <h2>Benefits of Our Micro  Loans</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Emergency Cash:</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Affordable Repayments:</strong>Our micro loans come with reasonable interest rates and manageable repayment terms, making it easier to fit the loan into your budget.</li>
        <li><strong>No Hidden Fees:</strong>: We pride ourselves on transparency. There are no hidden fees or surprises with our micro loans, so you can borrow with confidence.</li>
        <li><strong>User-Friendly Process:</strong>Our application process is designed to be simple and straightforward, ensuring a smooth experience from start to finish.</li>
        <li><strong>Quick Turnaround:</strong>With our fast approval and disbursement process, you’ll have access to the funds you need in no time.</li>
    </ul>
</section>



<section id="apply" class="container">
    <h2>How It Works</h2>
    <ol>
        <li><strong>Apply Online:</strong>Start by filling out a secure online application form with your personal and financial details. Our process is designed to be quick and straightforward.</li>
        <li><strong>Get Approved:</strong>Once your application is reviewed, you’ll receive a decision quickly. If approved, the funds will be deposited directly into your account.</li>
        <li><strong>Receive Funds:</strong>Once approved, the money will be available to you right away. Use it to manage your immediate financial needs.</li>
        <li><strong>Repay Easily:</strong>Repay your micro loan according to the agreed terms. We offer flexible repayment options to make managing your loan convenient.</li>
    </ol>
</section>

<section id="faq" class="container">
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h2>
    <div class="faq-section">
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">What documents do I need to apply for a micro loan?</div>
            <div class="faq-answer">Generally, you’ll need proof of identity (such as a passport or driver’s license), proof of address (like a utility bill), and proof of income (such as a salary slip or bank statement). These documents help us verify your application.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">How long does it take to get approved for a micro loan?</div>
            <div class="faq-answer">Approval times are usually very quick. You can expect to receive a decision and the funds within a short period, often within a day or two.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">Can I apply for more than one micro loan at a time?</div>
            <div class="faq-answer">While you can apply for multiple micro loans, it’s important to manage them responsibly. Overextending yourself financially can lead to repayment challenges.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">How do I check the status of my micro loan application?</div>
            <div class="faq-answer">You can check the status of your application by logging into your RupeeXpert account or contacting our customer support team.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">What should I do if my micro loan application is denied?</div>
            <div class="faq-answer">If your application is denied, review the feedback provided and consider improving your financial situation before reapplying. You may also explore other loan options that better match your profile.</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('.faq-question').forEach(question => {
      question.addEventListener('click', () => {
